    <!-- Our Story -->
    <section class="section-padding">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="story-grid">
                <div class="story-content">
                    <h2>Our Story</h2>
                    <p>Founded in 2010 in Welland, Ontario, GreatWellness Services began with a simple vision: to provide healthcare staffing that truly puts people first. Our founder, a healthcare professional with over 20 years of experience, saw the need for a more personalized approach to staffing—one that considered not just qualifications, but also personality, values, and individual care philosophies.</p>
                    <p>What started as a small local service has grown into a trusted provider across the Niagara Region and beyond. We've maintained our commitment to person-centered care while expanding our services to include both facility staffing and direct family care.</p>
                    <div class="stats-grid">
                        <div class="stat">
                            <h3>13+</h3>
                            <p>Years of Service</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat">
                            <h3>500+</h3>
                            <p>Healthcare Professionals</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat">
                            <h3>200+</h3>
                            <p>Families Served</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat">
                            <h3>120+</h3>
                            <p>Facility Partners</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="story-image">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559757148-5c350d0d3c56?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1170&q=80" alt="Diverse healthcare team meeting">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Mission, Vision, Values -->
